type: software
title: "BTK Field App — ბტკ საველე აპლიკაცია"
abstract: >
  A free, open-source field survey platform for landscape natural-territorial complexes (NTC/BTC),
  designed for students and researchers in landscape geography.
  Developed at Business and Technology University (BTU) and published under the
  Georgian Cartographers Association. Runs on Android, Windows, Linux, and the web.
